{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "profile": "features",
  "note": "REO First Person's code sites on Resident Evil Outbreak (NTSC-U) SLUS-20765 v2.00: camera.freeze (the game's camera handlers stop writing the camera while the camera is in her eyes), the game frame (recomp_on_play_main), the pad mapper (recomp_on_pad_map: while the right stick turns the view, the left stick's direction the game reads is turned back, so she walks as without the look) and the room's draw loop (recomp_on_room_draw: J's Bar's restroom mirrors). The program compiles them into the game at the first preparation; every original instruction is given as its xxh64 hash only, the words are read from your own disc and checked. 'option' names the mod setting that switches the feature.",
